# Pre-commit Verification

After making code changes, run pre-commit before finishing:

```bash
uv run pre-commit run --all-files
```

Equivalent Makefile target: `make pc`

## When to run

- After editing Python, Vue/TS, config, or other tracked project files
- Before claiming work is complete or ready to commit

## If hooks fail

1. Fix reported issues (lint, format, etc.)
2. If a formatter hook modified files, include those changes
3. Re-run `uv run pre-commit run --all-files` until all hooks pass

Do not skip hooks or leave lint/format failures for the user to fix.
